DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ggeettppaaggeessiizzeess() function retrieves page size information from the sys‐
     tem.  When it is called with _p_a_g_e_s_i_z_e specified as NULL and _n_e_l_e_m speci‐
     fied as 0, it returns the number of distinct page sizes that are sup‐
     ported by the system.  Otherwise, it assigns up to _n_e_l_e_m of the system-
     supported page sizes to consecutive elements of the array referenced by
     _p_a_g_e_s_i_z_e.  These page sizes are expressed in bytes.  In this case,
     ggeettppaaggeessiizzeess() returns the number of such page sizes that it assigned to
     the array.

