     If successful, the ggeettppaaggeessiizzeess() function returns either the number of
     page sizes that are supported by the system or the number of supported
     page sizes that it assigned to the array referenced by _p_a_g_e_s_i_z_e.  Other‐
     wise, it returns the value -1 and sets _e_r_r_n_o to indicate the error.

