     The ggeettppaaggeessiizzeess() function will succeed unless:

     [EINVAL]           The _p_a_g_e_s_i_z_e argument is NULL and the _n_e_l_e_m argument
                        is non-zero.

     [EINVAL]           The _n_e_l_e_m argument is less than zero.

